      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طِئَةٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَأَةٌ</span></b>  (in both of which the final <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ة</span> is
a substitute for the incipient <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">و</span>, S) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَطَآءَةٌ</span></b> 
(S, K) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وُطُوءَةٌ</span></b>  (K) <i>Plainness, levelness,
